e, Inc.（「Axon」、「本公司」、「我們」）是一家提供整合硬體和軟體解決方案的科技公司。 Axon 自 1993 年起由創辦人領導，以保護生命為使命，現已發展成為一家為眾多客戶提供服務的全球科技公司。我們的產品和服務使公共和私營部門的客戶能夠捕獲和使用關鍵數據來支援完全連接的營運工作流程。我們值得信賴的網路將軟體和硬體與一系列連接設備無縫集成，包括 TASER 能源設備、攝影機和感測器、無人機和機器人、基於雲端的證據管理、記錄管理、即時操作軟體、重大事件和緊急響應系統、沉浸式培訓和生產力工具，所有這些都透過人工智慧 (“AI”) 增強。這些解決方案旨在協同工作，創建一個 u"},{"en":"Our integrated technology platform of hardware and software solutions advances our mission to (i) make the bullet obsolete, (ii) reduce social conflict, and (iii) enable a fair and effective justice system. Our products and technology solutions address complex, high-stakes challenges, and our mission attracts top talent. We aim to invent and deliver technology solutions that progressively make the right things easier and the wrong things harder every day.","zh":"我們的硬體和軟體解決方案整合技術平台推進了我們的使命：(i) 淘汰子彈；(ii) 減少社會衝突；(iii) 建立公平有效的司法系統。我們的產品和技術解決方案可應對複雜、高風險的挑戰，我們的使命吸引頂尖人才。我們的目標是發明和提供技術解決方案，逐步讓正確的事情變得更容易，讓錯誤的事情變得更加困難。"},{"en":"Axon is a diversified technology company with employees distributed across multiple geographies. Alongside our primary corporate headquarters in Scottsdale, Arizona, we have hubs in many major cities across the United States and ongoing international expansion across Europe, Asia, and the Americas, as we continue to drive our mission globally.","zh":"Axon 是一家多元化科技公司，員工分佈在多個地區。除了位於亞利桑那州斯科茨代爾的主要公司總部外，我們還在美國許多主要城市設有樞紐，並在歐洲、亞洲和美洲持續進行國際擴張，繼續在全球範圍內推動我們的使命。"}],"markets":[{"en":"During the year ended December 31, 2025, we realigned our business to better reflect our continued growth and expansion of our technology solutions. Previously reported within two reportable segments, TASER and Software and Sensors, we realigned our business in a manner that provides increased transparency and distinction between our software and services and hardware components.","zh":"截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日的年度，我們重新調整了業務，以更好地反映我們技術解決方案的持續成長和擴展。在此之前，我們在兩個可報告部門（TASER 和軟體和感測器）中進行了報告，我們以提高軟體、服務和硬體組件之間的透明度和差異的方式重新調整了我們的業務。"},{"en":"Axon's operations comprise a fully integrated suite of products across connected hardware, software, and services which are disclosed in two reportable segments:","zh":"Axon 的業務包括跨連網硬體、軟體和服務的完全整合的產品套件，這些產品在兩個可報告部門中揭露："}],"customers":[{"en":"Our core customers across the public and private sectors include U.S. federal, state, and local governments, international governmental entities, commercial enterprises, and consumers. Axon's sales force and strong customer relationships represent key strategic advantages. Although the majority of our revenues are generated via direct sales, we also leverage distribution partners and third party resellers. No customer represented more than 10% of total net sales for the years ended December 31, 2025, 2024 or 2023. As we diversify into new markets, we have been investing in sales personnel and strategic headcount additions to support growth in these markets.","zh":"我們的公共和私營部門核心客戶包括美國聯邦、州和地方政府、國際政府實體、商業企業和消費者。 Axon 的銷售團隊和強大的客戶關係代表了關鍵的策略優勢。儘管我們的大部分收入是透過直接銷售產生的，但我們也利用分銷合作夥伴和第三方經銷商。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日、2024 年或 2023 年，沒有客戶佔總淨銷售額的 10% 以上。隨著我們向新市場多元化發展，我們一直在投資銷售人員和策略人員增加，以支持這些市場的成長。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Connected Devices","val":1576864000,"zh":"連接裝置"},{"name":"Software & Services","val":1202672000,"zh":"軟體與服務部門"},{"name":"Software & Sensors","val":1202672000,"zh":"軟體和感測器部門"}],"total":2779536000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Service","val":1202672000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"Software & Services","val":1202672000,"zh":"軟體與服務"},{"name":"TASER Devices Professional","val":913883000,"zh":"專業泰瑟槍設備"},{"name":"Personal Sensors","val":397035000,"zh":"個人感測器"},{"name":"Platform Solutions","val":265946000,"zh":"平台解決方案"}],"total":2779536000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":2305012000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":474524000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":2779536000}},"peers":["APP","HWM","AVAV","ANET","DDOG"]}}